      "description": "Hierarchical classification of the customer's Contact Reason (L1) AND Root Cause (L2) for Evolve support tickets. L1 = Contact Reason category (11 groups); L2 = the specific Root Cause valid within that Contact Reason -- the same root-cause label (e.g. 'Other', 'Not enough info') legitimately repeats under multiple different L1 parents with distinct descriptions. Assign the single best-fitting LEAF code (e.g. CR4.2).",
